meta {
  name: 09 Device Summaries
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/devices/summary
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  `GET /devices/summary` — reported state per device: which OS version and
  which applications each device is actually running right now, plus its
  tenant.
  
  **Expect:** the slicer and loader IPCs alive and on the baseline OS
  version, both under the tenant `Aldi Süd – Cheese Line Nürnberg`.
}
